...please stop livestreaming. Thank you, everyone. We really appreciate your cooperation.

107
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:32,160
好了 我們繼續 稍微轉換一下氣氛 因為有些粉絲是特地買票來到現場
All right, let's continue. We need to switch gears a little because some people came here specifically...

108
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:38,240
為了享受這份專屬的現場體驗 如果現在開直播 那些沒搶到票的朋友們
...for this exclusive experience, and we're livestreaming it right now. The people who couldn't get tickets...

109
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:42,920
心裡一定會很難過 大家為了這兩位女孩付出這麼多心血 我們可不能佔大家便宜
...would be disappointed. They went to so much effort for these two, and we shouldn't take advantage of that.

110
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:47,560
這樣真的不行 如果大家真的很愛這兩位女孩 請千萬不要開直播 好嗎
We can't do that. If you really love the girls, please don't do it. Don't, okay?

111
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:52,839
真會跟隨潮流 嘆氣 真的很跟得上時代 好了 說回到拍攝這件事
So modern! [Sigh] Very modern indeed. Now, speaking of the filming...

112
00:09:52,839 --> 00:10:00,040
以及過程中所面臨的挑戰 有沒有哪一場戲是特別觸動妳或讓妳印象深刻的 P'Ao 有嗎
...and the challenges involved, was there any scene that really touched you or left an impression? P'Ao, was there one?

113
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:07,320
有沒有哪一場戲是妳拍完當下心想 我真的好愛這場戲 我為這個作品感到非常驕傲
Was there a scene you filmed and thought, "I really love this! I'm so proud of this work"?

114
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:10,120
我很喜歡的戲嗎 實在太多場了
I love... So many scenes!

115
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:16,680
妳可不能爆雷大結局的戲喔 喔 妳最喜歡結局的戲嗎 那妳就什麼都不能講了 等等 我也不知道啦
You can't tell us about the ending scene! Oh, you like the ending scene? Then you won't have to say anything... Wait, I don't know!

116
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:23,760
這樣主持人很難接下去主持耶 不過說真的 在製作一個作品的時候
That makes it pretty hard for the host to continue! But really, when you're working on a project...

117
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:29,120
幾乎每一場戲我們都必須全心去愛 因為如果連我們自己都不愛 觀眾又怎麼可能會喜歡
...you have to love almost every scene, because if we don't love them, the audience will never love them either.

118
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,000
真的完全不可能喜歡 嗯嗯
...at all. Mm-hmm.

119
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,800
所以一定有些戲對我們來說格外的特別 像是 Dee 哭的那場戲
So there may be some scenes that feel more special than others, such as the scene where Dee cries...

120
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:40,279
眼眶裡泛著淚水 那一幕真的很動人 嗯嗯
...with tears in her eyes. Mm-hmm.

121
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:46,839
還有她們兩個人在床上互許終身的那場戲 雖然那場戲非常短
And the scene where the two of them get married on the bed. Even though it was a very short scene...

122
00:10:46,839 --> 00:10:52,680
但卻清清楚楚展現出她們到底有多深愛彼此 我們在戲裡從沒聽過這個女人親口說出我愛妳 但是
...it clearly showed how much these two love each other. We never actually hear this woman say "I love you," but...

123
00:10:52,680 --> 00:11:00,560
她所做的一切 她生命中的每一分每一秒 全都毫無保留獻給了同一個女人
...everything she does, every second of her life, is devoted to just one woman.

124
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:06,480
我必須說 每一場戲我都非常喜歡 我覺得整部劇的運鏡和畫面真的美極了
And I have to say, I love every scene. I think the cinematography is so beautiful.

125
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:11,440
這一點真的要好好感謝攝影團隊 這部劇的畫面美感真的無懈可擊 粉絲們看這部劇
We have to thank the crew for that. The visuals in this series are gorgeous. The fans really...

126
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:19,120
絕對是值回票價 光看那些運鏡角度和鏡頭構圖 真的美到不行 就算是用了美圖秀秀
...get their money's worth. Just look at the camera angles and the shots. They're absolutely stunning. Even with Meitu...

127
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:23,920
我們自己也修不出那麼好看的畫面 說真的 大家都能看出畫面有多柔和多精緻對吧
...we couldn't make ourselves look that good! Seriously, everyone can see how soft and beautiful the images are, right?

128
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:29,399
妳也誇獎得太誇張了吧 沒有 我是認真的 我自己看了都覺得 哇 怎麼連我的鼻子看起來都這麼立體
You're praising it too much! No, I'm serious. I watched it and thought, "Wow, even my nose looks so...

129
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:33,399
五官輪廓分明 完全沒有死角 就算我自己再怎麼打光修圖也拍不出這麼柔美的質感 妳懂我意思吧
...perfectly sculpted, with no shadows, and I still don't look this beautiful and soft!" You know what I mean?

130
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:36,399
這都是有專業技術在裡面的 我們攝影組有獨門技術 對吧
There are techniques involved. We have our techniques. Right?

131
00:11:36,399 --> 00:11:40,480
完全沒錯 這可是頂級畫質 高級享受 我們只是
Exactly. It's premium. Premium! We just...

132
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:44,279
想看這種頂級神顏必須開尊榮會員才行 沒錯沒錯 因為我們家女孩每個鏡頭都美若天仙
We need a premium membership for that. Yes, yes, because our girls look beautiful in every shot.

133
00:11:44,279 --> 00:11:46,959
對呀 這可是商業機密
Right. So that's a secret.

134
00:11:46,959 --> 00:11:52,240
對 這是頂級機密 不過平心而論 每一場戲都美得像幅畫 有時候在拍電視劇
Yes, it's premium. But honestly, every scene is beautiful. Sometimes, when you're filming a drama...

135
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:57,360
往往正是那些細膩的小橋段最能打動人心 慢慢累積醞釀成刻在大家心中的名場面
...it's the little scenes that really touch people. They grow into these bigger scenes that stay with everyone.

136
00:11:57,360 --> 00:12:03,079
那 Lena 還有 Miu 呢 妳們自己有沒有哪一場戲是最觸動妳們內心的
And what about you, Lena and Miu? Was there a scene that really touched you?

137
00:12:03,079 --> 00:12:09,079
喔 親密接觸的戲嗎 牽手摸摸的那種戲嗎 沒錯 就是妳們最喜歡也最難忘的戲
Oh, the touch scene? The touch scene? Yes, the one you really liked and found memorable.

138
00:12:09,079 --> 00:12:12,440
在這部劇裡面 喔 就是妳們最喜歡的 沒錯
In this series. Oh, the one you liked. Right.

139
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:16,480
現場工作人員可以幫我們把照片投在螢幕上嗎 那場是我們之前對流程說好的那一場嗎
Maybe the crew can put it up on the screen for us. Was that the scene we were briefed about?

140
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:19,519
不是 我是說 我們今天是要聊自己最喜歡的一場戲 沒錯吧
No, I mean, were we supposed to talk about our favorite scene? Is that right?

141
00:12:19,519 --> 00:12:24,360
對呀 一場戲跟一個橋段本來就是同一個意思 寶貝
Yes. A scene and a sequence mean the same thing, darling.

142
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:27,800
我哪知道 原來是同一個意思 所以我剛剛才說他們等一下可能會放照片出來
I didn't know that! That's why I said maybe they'd show us a picture...

143
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:33,760
P'Ao 剛剛心裡肯定在想 妳們這是在故意套路我吧 場景跟橋段本來就是同一件事
P'Ao was probably thinking, "You're really setting me up here!" A scene and a sequence mean the same thing.

144
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:39,880
我剛差點就要脫口說 不好意思 好了 妳們心裡有最喜歡的那場戲了嗎
I was about to say, "I'm sorry." Okay, do you have a scene that you really love?

145
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:42,600
有的 我挑好了 喔 那妳可以公布答案了
Yes, I do. Oh, then you can answer!

146
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:46,639
我現在很清楚是哪一場 因為我早就已經仔細想過了
Now I know which one, because I've already thought it through carefully...

147
00:12:46,639 --> 00:12:50,600
就是這一場 其實工作人員準備了好幾場可以選 因為
...and it's this scene. There are actually several scenes to choose from, because...

148
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:54,440
他們準備了好幾張備用 怕妳們臨時改變主意想聊別的
...they prepared a few in case you wanted to change your mind about which one to talk about.

149
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:58,920
其實我本來準備了四個場景 但我真正最想聊的那一場是現在還不能說的
I actually prepared four scenes, but the one I want to talk about is one I can't mention...

150
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:03,680
因為那是大結局裡的重頭戲 喔 又來了 又想賣關子了
...because it's in the final episode. Oh, here we go again!

151
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:10,160
我是認真的啦 沒有在鬧大家 可以放出來給大家看嗎 Miu 我們可以放嗎
I'm serious! I'm not teasing you. Can we show it? Miu, can we show it?

152
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:13,120
可以嗎 放是可以放 可是他們整張都會打滿馬賽克耶
Can we? We can, but they'll blur everything out.

153
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:17,920
我們可以放出來對吧 請問工作人員可以放這張嗎
We can show it, right? Are we allowed to show it?

154
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:22,160
大家想不想看 想看對不對
Do you want to see it? You do, right?

155
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:23,560
我才不想看 妳明明就很想看
No, I don't! Yes, you do!

156
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:26,760
出來了 出來了 沒錯 就是這張
There it is, there it is! Oh, that's right!

157
00:13:26,760 --> 00:13:33,639
這就是我選的照片 等等 這張照片是
This is the picture I chose. Just a moment. Who...

158
00:13:33,639 --> 00:13:38,199
是誰 這張照片是誰做的 妳是借了高級修圖帳號來用嗎
...is it? Um, who made this picture? Did you borrow a premium account?

159
00:13:38,199 --> 00:13:40,880
P'Ao 也有借帳號 這樣畫面才會變得更清晰一點
P'Ao, too! That way the picture will be clearer.

160
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:45,560
各位 這是 Miu 整部劇中最喜歡的名場面 因為這場戲有著非常深厚
Everyone, this is Miu's favorite scene in the series, because it has such a meaningful...

161
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:56,440
而且深遠的寓意 大家能看出什麼 我看不到畫面 我只看得到沙子 我真的很喜歡這場戲裡的沙灘
...impact. What can you see? I can't see it. I can see sand. I really like the sand in this scene.

162
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:59,360
這就是讓我感觸最深的一場戲 但這場戲是在大結局裡面
This is the scene that left an impression on me, but it's in the final episode.

163
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:03,720
沒錯 我真的很想跟大家聊 但現在不能說 如果現在就劇透 今晚看大結局就沒驚喜了
Exactly. I want to talk about it, but I can't. If I tell you, there's no point watching it tonight!

164
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,639
我們待會兒要一起看 所以這份感動我們就先留在心底
We have to watch it together, so let's keep it to ourselves for now.

165
00:14:05,639 --> 00:14:09,440
對 先好好珍藏在我們心中 哇 這話說得好有深度
Yes, let's keep it in our hearts. Oh, that's deep!

166
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:15,680
非常有深度 太深奧了 我們繼續 那 Lena 呢 妳心裡有沒有哪一場戲
Very deep, very deep. Let's move on. And what about you, Lena? Do you have a scene...

167
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:19,959
是哪一場呢 我大概挑了三場 但其中這一場
Which scene? I picked about three scenes, but this one...

168
00:14:19,959 --> 00:14:28,040
展現了這兩個角色的深度 就是第一集她們在酒吧碰杯的那場戲
...shows the depth of both characters. It's the scene where they clink glasses in episode one.

169
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:29,240
沒錯 嗯嗯
Yes. Mm-hmm.

170
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:34,320
能讓我們看一下照片嗎 讓我們瞧瞧 第一集碰杯的那場戲 是這張嗎
Can we see it? Let's have a little look. The scene where they clink glasses? This one?

171
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:40,480
對 那場戲其實超級難演 因為我們在演的時候 早已經習慣了彼此經歷過種種風雨後的 Pheem 和 Pan
Yes. It was really difficult because when we played them, we were used to the version of Pim and Pa...

172
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:44,480
但是我們卻必須倒回去演第一集 當時彼此甚至連對方的身家背景都還不清楚
...who had already been through so much together. But we had to go back and play episode one again...

173
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:49,199
但內心卻有一種強烈的渴望 那種那天晚上
...when we didn't know each other's backgrounds yet. There was this desire, this feeling that...

174
00:14:49,199 --> 00:14:52,680
極度渴望想要得到對方的感覺 妳懂那種感覺嗎
...we wanted the other person so badly that night, you know?

175
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:56,959
那是一種 充滿新鮮感的悸動 妳懂嗎
It was... Fresh, you know?

176
00:14:56,959 --> 00:15:00,440
大家剛才看到那顆閃亮的星星了嗎 每一場戲我們都必須設定非常明確的動機
Did you see that star just now? For every scene, we need to have a clear objective...

177
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:05,480
否則整場戲就立不起來 所以我當時給自己的角色動機就是 我超級渴望妳
...otherwise the scene won't work. So I set my objective as: I want you so badly...

178
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:12,480
無論如何我都要用盡所有手段 把妳牢牢握在我的掌心裡 等等 妳這話是什麼意思
...and I'll do whatever it takes to have you right in the palm of my hand. Wait, what do you mean by that?

179
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:17,680
妳這話是什麼意思 妳打算怎麼做 妳是想像拆禮物那樣
What do you mean? How are you going to do that? You want to unwrap it like...

180
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:23,360
拆一份全新的禮物 迫不及待想打開看看裡面裝什麼 沒錯 P'Boom 和 P'Ao 當時就是用一模一樣的詞形容 說就像是
...a brand-new present, like a gift you can't wait to open and see what's inside. Exactly. P'Beam and P'Ao used that exact phrase. They said it was like...

181
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:26,600
拆一份令人心癢難耐的全新禮物 哎呀
...a brand-new gift that we really wanted to unwrap. Oh!

182
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:31,160
所以整場戲必須表現出極度的渴望 可是同一時間
So it had to feel like we wanted it so badly, but at the same time...

183
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:37,440
又必須拿捏出一種柔和與細膩 不能太強勢霸道 必須循序漸進慢慢勾引
...there had to be a certain softness, a gentleness. It couldn't be too forceful; it had to happen gradually.

184
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:40,600
沒錯 對 不能表現得太用力或是
Right. Yes, we couldn't just make it too intense or...

185
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,639
太過兇猛進攻 完全正確
...too aggressive. Exactly.

186
00:15:42,639 --> 00:15:45,560
所以我覺得這場戲是能把那種
So this scene was one where I felt...

187
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:50,519
內心情感詮釋得非常淋漓盡致的一幕 裡面有很多細膩的層次 不管是 Pheem
...the emotions came across really well. It had so many layers. Whether it was Pim...

188
00:15:50,519 --> 00:15:55,440
還是 Pan 兩個人都有自己撩人的小手段和小把戲 我覺得這真的是
...or Pa, each of them had their own little tricks and ways of flirting. I felt that it was...

189
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:59,800
一場層次非常豐富的戲 大家一定都回去重刷好幾遍對吧
...a very nuanced scene. You have to go back and watch it again, right?

190
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:05,120
我相信在場各位一定都把這場戲看過無數遍了 相信我
I believe everyone has watched this scene many times. Trust me!

191
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:08,079
妳們到底看了幾遍 被抓包了吧
How many times have you watched it? You've been caught!

192
00:16:08,079 --> 00:16:12,040
看了幾遍 到底看了幾遍 四五遍嗎
How many times? How many times? Four or five times?

193
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:14,120
一百遍 居然看了一百遍
One hundred. One hundred times!

194
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:19,959
現場有人看超過一百遍的嗎 一百遍 那只是第一輪刷劇的次數好不好
Anyone watched it more than 100 times? 100 times? That's just the first round!

195
00:16:19,959 --> 00:16:24,680
天啊 這計算方式也太驚人了吧 總之 今天
Oh, no, no! That's a different kind of count. Anyway, today...

196
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:28,399
我有準備幾個不同角度的問題 想請兩位女孩分享妳們的心底話
...I have some questions from a different angle. I want the girls to share their stories...

197
00:16:28,399 --> 00:16:33,680
聊聊這一路上走到大結局的種種心路歷程 現場收集了許多粉絲們
...about everything they've been through on the journey to the final episode. We have questions from fans...

198
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:42,920
特地寫給兩位女孩的提問 我們今天就來好好念一念 我手上拿到了幾題 但在開始之前 我想先
...that they've sent in for the girls. Let's read them today. I have a few questions here. But first, I'd like to...

199
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:47,880
邀請另一位在作品中非常重要的靈魂人物來到台上一同加入我們
...invite another very important person from Love, Can You? to join us.

200
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:48,800
沒錯 正是如此
Yes. That's right.

201
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:54,160
妳們準備好了嗎 五四三二 妳在說誰 為什麼我都完全不知情
Have you prepared yourself, 5432? Who are you talking about? Why don't I know anything about this?

202
00:16:54,160 --> 00:17:03,121
讓我們熱烈歡迎 Thunwa 來到台上 Thunwa 可以跟大家揮個手嗎
Please welcome Khun Thunwa to the stage! Khun Thunwa, may we have a little wave?

203
00:17:03,121 --> 00:17:05,141
歡呼聲
[Cheering]

204
00:17:09,016 --> 00:17:12,720
歡呼聲 音樂 請進
[Cheering] [Music] Please...

205
00:17:22,116 --> 00:17:28,600
音樂 Khun Fah 妳怎麼會跑來 怎麼沒先跟我說一聲 哎呀
[Music] Khun Fah, how did you get here? Why didn't you tell me? Oh!

206
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:33,799
不要看 哈囉 Khun Wa 完全沒有人知道你要來耶
Don't look! Hello, Khun Wa. Nobody knew you were coming!

207
00:17:33,799 --> 00:17:41,640
好興奮喔 我好興奮 新星登場囉 哈囉 Thunwa
I'm excited! I'm excited! A new star is making an appearance! Hello, Khun Thunwa.

208
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:43,600
哈囉 媽媽 哈囉
Hello, Mom. Hello!

209
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:46,960
而且你們的衣服也太像了吧 根本像雙胞胎 明明沒有先約好
And your outfits look so much alike, like twins, even though you didn't plan it!

210
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:52,320
Khun Wa 跟大家說說到底怎麼回事 你根本沒跟我說會有這一齣 你沒跟我說
Khun Wa, tell us what's going on! You didn't tell me this was going to happen. You didn't tell me...

211
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:58,640
你會以這麼華麗的方式登場 我有先跟你說好不好 好了 我是來幫你打工的
...you were going to make such a grand entrance! I did tell you! Okay, I'll work for you.

212
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:04,320
你也完全沒跟我說 而且你也沒跟工作人員說
You didn't tell me either. And you didn't tell the crew that...

213
00:18:04,320 --> 00:18:08,559
我們的時間非常有限 你知道我們有時間限制對吧
...we'd have such a limited amount of time. You know we have a time limit, right?

214
00:18:08,559 --> 00:18:13,280
你知道這部劇馬上就要播出了對吧 好啦 給你兩分鐘 自我介紹一下吧
You know the series has to go on air, right? All right, you have two minutes. Introduce yourself!

215
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:18,640
大家好 我是 Tan 今天跟 Nong Phon 還有 Khun Wa 一起來 歡呼聲
Hello, I'm Tan. I'm here with Nong Phon and Khun Wa. [Cheering]

216
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:23,919
到底是誰把我朋友弄哭了 是誰讓我們家女孩掉眼淚的
Who made my friend cry? Who made our girl shed tears?

217
00:18:23,919 --> 00:18:28,927
到底發生什麼事了 別讓她看起來比我還漂亮喔 我會受不了 歡呼聲
What happened? Don't make her look prettier than me. I can't handle it!

218
00:18:28,927 --> 00:18:31,120
歡呼聲 演藝圈新星
[Cheering] A new talent!

219
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:34,880
新星報到 Thunwa 你跟她們一起合作有一段時間了對吧
A new talent! Khun Thunwa, you've been working with them for a while now, right?

220
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:37,799
對 一起合作拍戲之後 覺得她們兩個人如何
Yes. How do you feel about them after working together?

221
00:18:37,799 --> 00:18:42,360
在跟她們朝夕相處之後 我覺得很幸福 一開始我還真不知道該怎麼跟她們相處
After spending time with them... I'm happy. At first, I didn't know how to act around them.

222
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:45,320
這位是大明星 那一位更是超級大巨星
This one is a big star, and that one is an even bigger star!

223
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:50,600
而我只不過是個三線小咖 哎呀 戲外還是可以正常聊天做生意對吧
But I'm only a third-tier star! Oh! You can still talk to them and do business as usual, right?

224
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:57,600
對 拍完戲之後 我們還是可以一起合夥做生意 Miu 不要聽 別讓小孩子聽到這個
Yes, after filming, we can still do business together. Miu, don't listen! Don't let the kids hear this!

225
00:18:57,600 --> 00:19:02,919
好了 讓我們把熱烈的掌聲獻給坐在左右兩邊的第一位表演指導老師
All right, let's give a big round of applause to the first acting coach...

226
00:19:02,919 --> 00:19:09,840
Khun Yena 老師總是說 不管演什麼 都要目標明確全力以赴 掌聲
...on the left and right, Khun Yena! She always says, "Whatever you play, make it clear and commit to it." [Applause]

227
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:15,400
然後我們也要好好感謝 P'Ao
And then we have to thank P'Ao...

228
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:22,600
還有另一位表演指導老師 真的非常感謝 這兩位都是我們最棒的表演教練
...and another coach as well. Thank you so much. Both of these people were our coaches...

229
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:29,640
而且這位老師總是帶來滿滿的能量 每次一進到房間 P'Nai P'Tan P'Su 好了 先說聲拜拜 我要先
...and this person brought so much energy. Whenever we came into the room, P'Nai, P'Tan, P'Su... Okay, bye-bye for now. I'm going to...

230
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:37,000
我臉上有長痘痘嗎 笑聲 我沒看到耶 真的有嗎 搞不好長大了想時光倒流
Do I have a pimple somewhere? [Laughter] I can't see one! Are you sure? Maybe it's grown and wants to turn back time...

231
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:42,000
想要重新縮回去 如果給我們一個小時的時間 我真的會
...and go back up again. If we had an hour, I'd...

232
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:45,440
把所有事全都說給你們聽 沒錯
...tell you absolutely everything! Yeah!

233
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:49,760
好了 既然都來到大結局了 看到兩位女孩取得這麼亮眼的成績
All right, since we're at the final episode, let's talk about the success we've seen the girls achieve...

234
00:19:49,760 --> 00:19:56,679
我們也要謝謝妳們 謝謝 P'Aom 也恭喜妳們兩位 這部劇對我而言
...and thank both of you. Thank you, P'Aom, and congratulations to you both. This series is one...

235
00:19:56,679 --> 00:20:02,480
是我人生中最快樂的事情之一 在這個機會降臨之前 我不知道自己還能不能這麼開心
...of the happiest things that has happened in my life. I didn't know if I'd ever feel this happy again until this opportunity came along...

236
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:09,240
跟劇組大家一起工作 讓我發自內心非常渴望成為一名優秀的演員
...and everyone I worked with made me feel that I really wanted to become an actor.

237
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:12,640
沒錯 無論走到哪裡 從來沒有人對我說過我的長相不夠好看
Yes. Wherever I went, nobody ever told me that my face wasn't...

238
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:15,880
或者不夠帥氣 這就夠了
...handsome or pretty enough. That's it!

239
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:20,320
剩下的大家自己腦補 我們長得很好看 很有自信 我們可是三線小明星
You can fill in the blank yourself! We look good. We look good. We're confident. We're third-tier stars!

240
00:20:20,320 --> 00:20:24,400
這感覺就像是送給我今年三十歲的生日大禮 就像是
This feels like a gift for this year, for my 30th birthday. It's like...

241
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:30,559
明年我就要三十一歲了 你們知道我又想要什麼嗎 我想要再要一份禮物 可是我不能說是什麼
...next year I'll be 31. You know what I want again? I want another gift! I can't tell you what it is!

242
00:20:30,559 --> 00:20:36,799
我想要一份禮物 活動結束之後 我要直接雇用這位主持人
I want a gift. After this event, I'll hire the host who...

243
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:44,000
太棒了 而且這個CP超好嗑 直女最愛逗我們了 今天的直女
Yes! And it's selling, too! Straight girls love teasing us. Today, the straight girls are...

244
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:47,799
完全跟我們玩開了 嘿 真的奏效了 天啊
...playing along with us! Hey, it's working! Oh my!

245
00:20:47,799 --> 00:20:53,919
那是 P'Boom 對吧 總之 謝謝妳們兩位對我這麼好 給了我這個寶貴的機會
Hey, P'Phum, right? Anyway, thank you both for being so kind and giving me this opportunity...

246
00:20:53,919 --> 00:20:58,720
也謝謝這部劇 我常常在想 如果哪一天我過得不順遂不快樂
...and for this series. I've always thought that if one day I wasn't happy...

247
00:20:58,720 --> 00:21:02,360
這部劇這段回憶 將會是支撐我繼續勇敢生活下去的最強大力量
...this would be the one thing that could make me strong enough to keep going with my life.

248
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:10,559
謝謝大家 也請大家多多支持 Tan 謝謝 Tan 從第一集一路陪著我們
Thank you. Please believe in Tan, too. And thank you, Tan, for being here with us...

249
00:21:10,559 --> 00:21:15,200
走到今天的最後一集 拍戲需要時間 朋友之間的情誼更是珍貴
...from the first episode to the final episode. Filming takes time, and friendship matters.

250
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:21,240
遇到好的夥伴 一起工作起來真的事半功倍 這真的是大實話
Having good colleagues makes the work go much more smoothly. That's really true.

251
00:21:21,240 --> 00:21:26,799
好啦 謝謝你 剛才真的是把我嚇了一大跳
All right, thank you! You scared me half to death!

252
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:32,039
你要留下 Dew 嗎 Dew 就坐在那邊耶
Are you keeping Dew? Dew is sitting over there!

253
00:21:34,294 --> 00:21:36,314
歡呼聲
[Cheering]

254
00:21:37,120 --> 00:21:42,039
太狠了吧 到最後主持人還得親自出來控場 大家別瞎攪和了
So fierce! In the end, the host had to shut it down. Don't get involved!

255
00:21:42,039 --> 00:21:50,360
我想問 喔 我就在等這個 老闆 問題都在這裡了 一個人抽三題 好嗎 每人抽三題
I want to ask... Oh, I was waiting for this! Boss, here are the questions. Three each, okay? Three questions per person.

256
00:21:50,360 --> 00:21:55,159
這些題目全都是現場粉絲親手寫的
These questions are from the fans.

257
00:21:55,400 --> 00:22:00,279
P'Ao 別緊張 讓女孩們來回答就好
P'Ao, don't be nervous! Let's hear from the girls.

258
00:22:00,279 --> 00:22:07,080
對 妳先陪我站在這裡 好 三個問題 Lena 妳直接抽三張 挑妳想回答的
Yes, stay here with me first. All right, three questions. Lena, just pick three. Go ahead and choose.

259
00:22:07,080 --> 00:22:14,905
有時候紙條上根本不算問題 總之選一張就對了 喔 好 抱歉抱歉
Sometimes they're not even questions, you just have to pick one. Oh, okay. Sorry, sorry!

260
00:22:14,905 --> 00:22:21,039
音樂 如果 Pheem 個性很差 媽媽還會要她嗎
[Music] If Pim had a bad personality, would Mom still want her?

261
00:22:24,799 --> 00:22:29,760
這算是一個問題 還是粉絲替大家發表的宣言 這是大家的宣言
Is this a question, or is it a statement from all of us? A statement from...

262
00:22:29,760 --> 00:22:35,480
這到底是什麼 算是正能量還是負能量 這是心聲還是提問 妳是在跟我們表白嗎
What is this? Is it positive or negative energy? Is this a statement or a question? Are you telling us something?

263
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:41,559
我再唸一次 如果 Pheem 個性很差 媽媽還會要她嗎
Let me read it again: "If Pim had a bad personality, would Mom still want her?"

264
00:22:41,559 --> 00:22:51,320
萬聖節快樂 所以答案是萬聖節快樂嗎 根本不是這樣回答的啦
Happy Halloween! So that's the answer? Happy Halloween? That's not it!

265
00:22:52,840 --> 00:22:58,190
如果妳們沒有結果 妳會回到媽媽身邊嗎 笑聲
If things don't work out, will you come back to Mom? [Laughter]

266
00:22:59,679 --> 00:23:03,640
活動幾點開始 可以再說一次嗎
What time does it start? Can you say that again?

267
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:11,520
什麼 再唸一次 如果妳們沒有結果 妳會回到媽媽身邊嗎
What? Say it again. "If things don't work out, will you come back to Mom?"

268
00:23:11,520 --> 00:23:15,960
什麼 我替妳回答好了 Pan 趕快從 Pheem 的角色裡退出來 寶貝
What? I'll answer for you: Pa, come out of Pim's character now, darling.

269
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:19,080
媽媽要親自來接收妳了
I'll take your place, Mom!

270
00:23:24,919 --> 00:23:30,760
下一題 第三個問題什麼時候來
Next question! When is the third one coming?

271
00:23:30,760 --> 00:23:35,360
對 P'Dew P'Dew 妳現在可以上台了嗎
Yeah. P'Dew, P'Dew, can you come up now?

272
00:23:35,360 --> 00:23:40,919
現場有人可以幫忙把聚光燈打在 P'Dew 身上嗎 她逃跑了 她逃跑了 她往那邊跑了
Can someone shine a light on P'Dew, please? She's running away! She's running away! She's running over there!

273
00:23:40,919 --> 00:23:44,919
她在那邊 妳是叫我們什麼都別說嗎 妳一直揮手比叉叉說不行不行
She's over there! Are you telling us not to say anything? You're waving your hands like, "No, no!"

274
00:23:44,919 --> 00:23:48,240
別照她 喔 也許她只是在招手叫我們過去 她就在這裡
Don't show them! Oh, maybe she's just waving us over. She's right here!

275
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:57,279
她就在這裡 也許她只是在比手勢 剛那是怎樣 P'Dew 快走進聚光燈裡 她落荒而逃了
She's right here! Maybe she's just gesturing. What was that? P'Dew, come into the spotlight! She's running away!

276
00:23:57,279 --> 00:24:02,720
她早就已經溜掉了 別跑 快回來 題目來了
She's run off already. Don't go! Come back! Here it is...

277
00:24:02,720 --> 00:24:10,241
Pheem 和 Pan 的故事結束了 但 Lena 和 Miu 可以繼續交往 太棒了 P'Nana 和 Nong Inna 歡呼聲
Pim and Pa's story is over, but Lena and Miu can keep dating! All right, P'Nana and Nong Inna! [Cheering]

278
00:24:11,360 --> 00:24:16,440
等等 這張到底是誰寫的 誰寫的 而且你們怎麼知道 你們怎麼知道
Wait! Who wrote this? Who wrote it? And how do you know? How do you know...

279
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:18,701
她們私底下沒有在交往
...that they're not dating?

280
00:24:18,701 --> 00:24:23,000
歡呼聲 你們怎麼會知道 她們在一起拍戲拍了
[Cheering] How do you know? They've been filming together...

281
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:29,520
好幾個月甚至好幾年 對吧 你看 妳在點頭 妳承認了對吧
...for months, maybe years, right? And look, you're nodding! So you admit it!

282
00:24:29,520 --> 00:24:32,760
沒有 我只是說她們認識很多年了 她們早就認識很久了
No, I just said they've known each other for years. They've known each other for a long time.

283
00:24:32,760 --> 00:24:36,559
認識幾年 那代表那只是一個數字 不是 好啦
How many years? That means it's a number, not... Okay!

284
00:24:36,559 --> 00:24:43,120
好啦 唸完了嗎 乾脆全部都唸一唸好了 反正只剩幾張而已
Oh, okay. Are we done? Let's just read them all. There are only a few left.

285
00:24:43,120 --> 00:24:47,240
P'Ao 妳也想唸一張嗎 來 這張給妳
P'Ao, do you want to read one, too? Here, take this one.

286
00:24:47,240 --> 00:24:52,600
我抽到這一張 這是什麼 別
I've got this one. What is it? Don't...

287
00:24:52,600 --> 00:24:57,039
那祝 Lena 和 Miu 生日快樂 歡呼聲
Well then, happy birthday, Lena and Miu! [Cheering]

288
00:24:57,039 --> 00:25:01,000
生日明明還有整整一個月 沒錯 還有一個月 我們在十一月二十五日
It's in another month! Yes, in another month. We'll finish on November 25...

289
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:04,799
不過還是非常謝謝大家提前送上的生日祝福
...but thank you for the early birthday wishes!

290
00:25:04,799 --> 00:25:09,360
而且她們還會辦活動喔 會幫我們辦生日派對
And they'll have an event, too. They'll have a birthday party for us!

291
00:25:09,360 --> 00:25:16,440
對 就在下個月 但大家應該早就買好票了吧 聽說早就全數秒殺了
Yes, that's next month. But you probably already have tickets, right? It's completely sold out!

292
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:21,080
完全秒殺 唸完了嗎 我們全部唸完了嗎 對 結束了 我們現在可以停了嗎
Completely sold out! Are we done? Are we done? Yes, we're done. Can we stop now?

293
00:25:21,080 --> 00:25:25,559
嘿 Mong Mong
Hey! Mong, Mong!

294
00:25:25,559 --> 00:25:28,679
怎樣 怎麼了 妳問是不是結束了 我們就回答對啊
What? What? You asked if we were done, and we said yes!

295
00:25:28,679 --> 00:25:29,880
然後 結束了
And... Done!

296
00:25:29,880 --> 00:25:31,880
喔 唸完了 真是抱歉 沒錯
Oh, we're done. I'm sorry! Yes!

297
00:25:31,880 --> 00:25:37,960
好啦 請用泰文講 抱歉 我們要等這艘 CP 帆船好好啟航
Okay, in Thai, please! Okay, sorry. We need to wait for the ship to sail properly...

298
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:42,640
並且把事情清清楚楚宣布給大家聽 順便溫馨提醒還沒領手環的朋友
...and make the announcement clearly. A little reminder for anyone who hasn't got their wristband...

299
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:46,760
請記得先去前台領取手環 因為等一下活動結束會有大合照環節 總之
...please go and collect it at the front, because after this we'll be taking photos together. Anyway...

300
00:25:46,760 --> 00:25:53,960
因為今天是最後一集大結局 我希望大家都能盡情拍照錄影 但請大家千萬不要剪輯
...since today is the final episode, I want everyone to enjoy filming clips as much as you like. But please don't edit...

301
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:59,200
請不要惡意剪輯或隨便掐頭去尾 今天就讓我們單純記錄這美好的一刻 老實說 P'Ao
...anything out or edit it however you like. Let's film together today, just for today. Honestly, P'Ao has...

302
00:25:59,200 --> 00:26:04,212
已經站了超級久 站了好長一段時間 笑聲
...been standing for a long time. Standing for ages! [Laughter]

303
00:26:04,600 --> 00:26:10,320
沒有啦 P'Ao 一直在幕後默默支持著女孩們 直到她們大獲成功 P'Ao 妳真的辛苦了
No, P'Ao has been supporting the girls behind the scenes until they became successful. P'Ao, you've worked so hard!

304
00:26:10,320 --> 00:26:14,159
辛苦嗎 誰說這是工作了 我今天又不是來工作的
Have you been working hard? Who said this was work? I didn't come here to work!

305
00:26:14,159 --> 00:26:19,039
快去吧 盡情享受 妳很喜歡跟粉絲們近距離接觸對吧 沒錯
Go on, enjoy yourself! You like being close to the fans, don't you? Exactly!

306
00:26:19,039 --> 00:26:24,200
P'Ao 這是怎麼回事 怎麼每次只要 P'Oh 一過來 大家都變得特別恩愛 妳真的很愛妳老公對吧
P'Ao, what's going on? Whenever P'O comes along, everyone gets so affectionate. You love your wife, right?

307
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:29,360
看看他們兩位 P'Oh 是我們另一位製作人對吧
Look at the two of them! P'Oh is another producer, right?

308
00:26:29,360 --> 00:26:32,600
他的名字是 Khun 呃 Khun Tee
His name is Khun Th... uh... Khun Tee.

309
00:26:32,600 --> 00:26:36,360
喔 Khun Tee 沒錯 就是那一整天都在疼愛著她們的大叔
Oh, Khun Tee! Yes, the uncle who's been loving them all day!

310
00:26:36,360 --> 00:26:40,120
對 待在離她們近一點的地方 那如果說到撒嬌的娃娃音
Right, stay close to them. And when we do the voices...

311
00:26:40,120 --> 00:26:45,120
Miu 會跟誰用那種娃娃音講話 Lena Miu 平常還會跟其他人用那種聲音說話嗎
Who does Miu do the voices with? Lena, does Miu ever do that voice with anyone else?

312
00:26:45,120 --> 00:26:48,600
那種教小孩子的撒嬌音嗎 她只會對我用那種聲音 絕對不會對別人這樣講話
The teaching voice? She only does that voice with me. She doesn't do it with anyone else.

313
00:26:48,600 --> 00:26:51,600
耶 真的 這可是千真萬確的事 我們絕對沒有亂編
Yeah! Hey, that's actually true. We're not making this up!

314
00:26:51,600 --> 00:26:55,200
真的是這樣 這就是
Really! This is...

315
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:59,080
片場平時的相處模式 現場的大家自己心裡有數 沒錯
You can judge for yourselves what it's like on set. Yeah!

316
00:26:59,080 --> 00:27:03,039
感覺就像是她們沉浸在自己的兩人世界裡 其他人都得跑去敲門提醒她們
It's like we're living in our own little world, and everyone else has to come and knock on the door...

317
00:27:03,039 --> 00:27:09,200
喂 妳們兩個是來工作的耶 Miu 快一點
...to remind us, "Hey, you're here to work!" Miu, hurry up!

318
00:27:09,200 --> 00:27:12,840
我很樂意耶
I'd like that!

319
00:27:15,399 --> 00:27:20,840
好啦 P'Ao 我們把時間留給妳跟 P'Oh 好好聚聚
All right, P'Ao, let's give you a moment with P'O.

320
00:27:23,039 --> 00:27:31,200
好的 先請 P'Ao 到台下休息 非常謝謝 P'Ao 謝謝妳
Oh, yes. Please step down from the stage. Thank you so much, P'Ao. Thank you!

321
00:27:31,200 --> 00:27:36,039
謝謝 P'Ao 幫忙促成了今天的耀眼成績 不過請大家先留下來
Thank you, P'Ao, for helping make this success possible. But please stay with us...

322
00:27:36,039 --> 00:27:40,679
因為我們接下來要玩小遊戲 而且我敢說 這個遊戲
...because we're going to play a game! And let me tell you, this game...

323
00:27:40,679 --> 00:27:47,480
可能會大成功 也可能會翻車 這是比手畫腳遊戲 我們會讓妳們挑一組題目 總共有
...may or may not be a success! It's a charades game. We'll let you choose a set of words. There are...

324
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:53,640
兩組 遊戲有兩組題目 第一組跟第二組
...two sets. The game has two sets of words: Set 1 and Set 2.

325
00:27:53,640 --> 00:28:00,440
選一組妳們想要的 誰先挑就可以先玩 然後另一個人負責比動作
Choose which one you want. Whoever picks first gets to play first, and then we'll have the other person act out...

326
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:07,279
把要猜的詞表演出來 好嗎 誰想先猜 我們要抽籤決定嗎
...the word that needs to be guessed. Okay? Who wants to go first? Should we draw lots?

327
00:28:07,279 --> 00:28:13,720
妳說的 先 是指先猜還是先比 都可以 先猜再比或是先比再猜都行
When you say "go first," do you mean guess first, or act first? Either way is fine. You can guess first, then act.

328
00:28:13,720 --> 00:28:18,120
怎樣都可以 我們很不擅長做選擇 P'Boom 拜託你幫我們選啦
Anything works. We don't like choosing! P'Boom, you choose for us, please.

329
00:28:18,120 --> 00:28:23,480
那我幫妳們選好了 妳們覺得誰比較擅長演戲比動作 誰應該先來
Then I'll choose for you. Who do you think is better at acting things out? Who should go first?

330
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:29,760
Miu 先 好 妳這是什麼意思 好啦好啦 我來負責比動作
Miu first. Okay! What do you mean? Sure, sure. I'll act it out.

331
00:28:29,760 --> 00:28:31,320
嘿 快點 開始比了喔
Hey! Go on, start acting!

332
00:28:31,320 --> 00:28:36,559
好 Miu 負責比動作 Lena 負責給提示 Miu 必須比出動作
All right, Miu will act it out, and Lena will give the clues. Miu has to act...

333
00:28:36,559 --> 00:28:42,600
讓 Lena 來猜詞 首先 選一個號碼 妳們想選哪一組
...while Lena guesses the word. First, choose a number. Which set do you want?

334
00:28:42,600 --> 00:28:47,159
第二組 第二組 好
Set 2. Set 2, okay.

335
00:28:47,159 --> 00:28:55,679
好 妳絕對不能偷看題目喔 轉過身去朝向那邊 大家都把頭轉過去
Okay, you mustn't look at the word. Turn around and face that way. Everyone, turn around!

336
00:28:55,679 --> 00:28:59,080
只有看得見字的人可以看
The person who can see it...

337
00:29:00,679 --> 00:29:07,440
不是啦 Miu 才是要負責比動作的人 現在輪到 Miu 比
No, Miu is the one who has to act it out. It's Miu's turn to act.

338
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:15,320
喔 原來是她要負責給動作提示 好的好的 來吧 我們開始囉
Oh, so she's the one giving the clues? Okay, okay. All right, let's go!

339
00:29:15,320 --> 00:29:22,880
千萬不要轉過來喔 因為答案就在這裡 會是由 Lena 負責看題目 別偷看喔
Don't turn this way, because the word is right here. Lena will be the one who sees it. Don't peek!

340
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:31,039
先拉勾打勾勾 要老實喔 必須要誠實 知道嗎
Promise first. Be honest! Be honest, okay?

341
00:29:32,279 --> 00:29:38,880
好 準備囉 好 我們要開始了
All right... Okay, we're starting!

342
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:46,840
哇 跳起來 雙手往前揮動
Whoa! Jump, and swing your arms forward!

343
00:29:46,840 --> 00:29:52,039
這是什麼 這到底是什麼 是一種體育運動嗎
What is it? What is that? Is it a kind of sport?

344
00:29:52,039 --> 00:29:56,039
然後雙手擺動 跳 跳起來
And then swing your arms... Jump, jump!

345
00:29:56,039 --> 00:30:01,679
跳得超級高 繼續跳高一點 這是一種競賽 妳以前跟朋友玩過這個嗎
Jump really high! Keep jumping high! It's a competition! Have you ever played this with your friends?

346
00:30:01,679 --> 00:30:06,200
有 我們一起玩過 大概兩個月前我們才剛剛一起玩過
Yes, we played together. We actually played together recently, about two months ago.

347
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:09,919
等等 那個叫什麼來著 就是那個妳在
Wait, what's that called? You know, the one where you...

348
00:30:09,919 --> 00:30:11,519
嘿 到底是什麼
Hey! What is it?

349
00:30:11,519 --> 00:30:19,000
就是一直跳對吧 在彈跳床上跳 對不對
You jump, right? And you jump on a trampoline, don't you?

350
00:30:21,799 --> 00:30:23,919
這是什麼 什麼劍術嗎
What is it? What kind of swords?

351
00:30:23,919 --> 00:30:27,640
我不知道 還是有好幾個招式 也許雙手
I don't know! Or are there several moves? Maybe you put your arms...

352
00:30:27,640 --> 00:30:34,320
併攏 雙手十指緊扣 握在一起 可以 Pass 跳過
...together, clasp your hands, and hold them together. You can skip it!

353
00:30:34,320 --> 00:30:39,240
好 下一題
Okay! Next one!

354
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:41,320
哇 好
Whoa! Okay!

355
00:30:41,320 --> 00:30:47,720
秀出妳的肌肉 展現妳的手臂線條 把它放大一千倍
Flex your muscles! Show off your muscles! Make them look a thousand times bigger!

356
00:30:47,720 --> 00:30:50,640
是因為身材嗎 對 因為肌肉線條
Because of the body? Yes! Because of the body!

357
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:51,960
因為身材 因為肌肉健美
Because of the body! Because of the body!

358
00:30:51,960 --> 00:30:54,080
因為身材 算身材過關 不用再等了
Because of the body! Count it as the body! There's no need to wait!

359
00:30:54,080 --> 00:30:55,480
對 不用等了 算答對了 就是身材
Yes, no need to wait! Because of the body!

360
00:30:55,480 --> 00:30:59,480
因為身材 等等 妳答對了 現在換妳要比給她猜
Because of the body! Wait, you got it right! Now you have to tell her to act it out!

361
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:02,919
喔 換我來比嗎 妳要跟她說要做什麼動作
Oh, I have to act it out? You have to tell her what to do!

362
00:31:02,919 --> 00:31:07,039
雙手在胸前來回擺動 來回揮動
Swing your arms back and forth in front of you. Swing them back and forth...

363
00:31:07,039 --> 00:31:12,720
在胸前 一直揮動 就像在打什麼東西一樣 雙手往前揮 繼續保持
...in front of you. Keep swinging, like you're hitting something. Swing your arms forward and keep going...

364
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:18,320
然後雙腿跟上 是這樣嗎 雙腿夾緊
...and then follow with your legs. Is that right? Your legs, squeezing together...

365
00:31:18,320 --> 00:31:22,880
雙腿要夾緊 不對 妳的腿在用力夾
Your legs squeeze together. No, your legs are squeezing!

366
00:31:22,880 --> 00:31:27,799
是什麼 尖叫聲 打鼓
What is it? [Screaming] Hit the drum!

367
00:31:28,440 --> 00:31:36,159
太厲害了 好了 猜完了嗎 只有這樣嗎 剛才那一題算得分嗎
Very good! Okay, are we done? Is that all? Can we count that?

368
00:31:36,159 --> 00:31:40,519
哇 這 這應該還不是最後一題對吧
Wow, that's... This isn't the last one, right?

369
00:31:40,519 --> 00:31:47,760
對 好 敲下去 敲下去
Yeah. All right, hit it! Hit it!

370
00:31:47,760 --> 00:31:50,760
Khun
Khun...

371
00:31:55,480 --> 00:32:01,760
動作是這樣 是像這樣子 它會 沒錯 有點像是
It goes like this. It's like this. It goes... Yeah, it's kind of...

372
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:06,240
泰國傳統音樂響起 那不是木琴嗎 還是圍琴
Thai music starts playing. Isn't that a khim? Or a ranat?

373
00:32:06,240 --> 00:32:11,880
對 喔 妳竟然知道什麼是泰國木琴
Yeah. Oh, you know what a ranat is?

374
00:32:11,880 --> 00:32:15,240
下一題
Next!

375
00:32:15,799 --> 00:32:26,360
Miu 快比動作 看那邊的題目 喔 妳也不能出聲 妳必須用演的
Miu, act it out. Look at the word over there. Oh, you can't speak either? You have to act it out!

376
00:32:26,360 --> 00:32:33,120
沒關係 好 我來比 原來是我們要告訴她該怎麼做
No, okay, I'll do it. We're supposed to tell her what to do!

377
00:32:35,480 --> 00:32:41,279
這是一個特定的動作姿勢 好
It's a kind of position... All right!

378
00:32:41,279 --> 00:32:46,840
對對對 把手放在平底鍋上方 嘿 妳在炒菜做飯 不對
Yes, yes! Put your hand over the pan. Hey, you're cooking! No!

379
00:32:46,840 --> 00:32:49,679
麵包師傅 主廚嗎
Baker? A chef?

380
00:32:49,679 --> 00:32:56,519
好 接著 把一條腿往前踢出去
Okay! Next, put one leg out in front of you...

381
00:32:56,519 --> 00:33:04,399
然後用力一踢 像這樣子 喔 對 就是那樣 踢
...and then kick it, like this. Oh, that's it! Kick!

382
00:33:04,399 --> 00:33:09,120
運動員嗎 不對 到底是什麼 藤球選手
An athlete? No, what is it? A takraw player!

383
00:33:09,120 --> 00:33:16,880
答對了 喔 把雙手比成一隻雞 那裡有一隻雞
Yes! Oh! Make your hands look like a chicken. There's a chicken!

384
00:33:16,880 --> 00:33:22,279
發動攻擊 啄啄啄 音樂 不對不對 根本不是那個
Attack, attack, attack! [Music] No, no, no, that's not it!

385
00:33:22,279 --> 00:33:31,320
大家會問 這到底是什麼 企鵝 鴨子
When people ask, "What is it?" ... Penguin? Duck?

386
00:33:31,320 --> 00:33:32,519
這到底是什麼
...? What is it?

387
00:33:32,519 --> 00:33:34,480
時間到 結束了 喔 原來那個詞是鴨子喔
That's it, we're done! Oh, the word was "duck"?

388
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:40,799
好 換下一題 剛剛那題妳答對了 好 雙手舉起來
Okay, switch to the next one. You got that one right. All right, put both hands up!

389
00:33:41,840 --> 00:33:44,480
耶 嘿
Yeah! Hey!

390
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:49,000
我們結束了嗎 就這樣囉
Are we done? That's it!

391
00:33:49,080 --> 00:33:55,360
妳其實很厲害耶 對 我在這方面很有天分 雖然
You're good, actually! Yes, I have a talent for this, even though...

392
00:33:55,360 --> 00:34:01,639
我一開始第一題誤會了題目 但我真的很佩服 妳完全沒讓我們失望
...I misunderstood the first one. I'm really impressed. You haven't let us down!

393
00:34:01,639 --> 00:34:06,519
妳真的很強 雖然一開始有點懵懵的 但我們原諒妳
You're really good, even if you were a little confused at first. We'll forgive you!

394
00:34:06,519 --> 00:34:11,918
原諒妳了 不過今天我們要當成熟的大人 今天大家要表現得像個大人一樣
We'll forgive you. But today, we have to be grown-ups. Today, we need to act like adults!

395
00:34:11,918 --> 00:34:14,719
才不要 大家快拿起別人的手機
No! Everyone, pick up someone else's phone!

396
00:34:14,719 --> 00:34:20,199
咦 各位 沒錯
Huh? Everyone, that's right!

397
00:34:20,199 --> 00:34:25,960
各位 現在立刻打開手機錄影 不管是誰 全場所有人 把手機舉起來
Everyone, start recording video now! No, all of us. Everyone, hold up your phones!

398
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:29,040
把手機舉高 拿出你們的相機
Hold them up! Your cameras, please!

399
00:34:29,040 --> 00:34:35,199
拿起你們的手機 按下錄影鍵 因為
Pick up your phones and press record, because...

400
00:34:35,719 --> 00:34:40,040
今天到底要由 Boom 來幫忙宣布 還是由她們兩位親自宣布呢
...today, should Boom make the announcement, or should they announce it themselves?

401
00:34:40,040 --> 00:34:48,560
我們親自來宣布 那今天就由妳們親自宣布 說吧
Let's make the announcement! Then you should make it today. Go ahead!

402
00:34:51,560 --> 00:34:55,199
等我一下 讓我想想該怎麼說 我們要宣布重大消息囉 重大消息要來囉
Let me think of what to say for a moment. We're making an announcement, we're making an announcement!

403
00:34:55,199 --> 00:35:01,839
好 今天想問問妳們兩位 為什麼剛才要請全場粉絲把手機舉起來錄影
Okay, today, we'd like to ask you both something. Why did you ask everyone to hold up their phones and record like this?

404
00:35:01,839 --> 00:35:04,680
妳們是不是有什麼重大消息要告訴大家
Do you have something to tell us?

405
00:35:04,680 --> 00:35:06,960
到底是什麼 一 二 三
What is it? One, two, three!

406
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:09,280
來 請開始 把手機舉高
Please, go ahead! Raise them!

407
00:35:09,280 --> 00:35:13,764
開始囉 歡呼聲
Go on! [Cheering]

408
00:35:19,604 --> 00:35:21,624
歡呼聲
[Cheering]

409
00:35:41,839 --> 00:35:44,839
呃
Uh...

410
00:35:48,680 --> 00:35:55,599
不要去撩台下的人啦 寶貝 先回這裡來 不然媽媽要打屁股了喔
Don't flirt with them! Come back here first, darling, or Mom's going to give you a smack!

411
00:35:56,079 --> 00:35:58,304
哎呀 尖叫聲
Oh! [Screaming]

412
00:36:04,040 --> 00:36:08,520
Lumi Lumi 來這裡 快來 Lumi
Lumi, Lumi, come here! Come on, Lumi!

413
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:30,400
呃
Uh...

414
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:34,985
好 歡呼聲
Okay! [Cheering]

415
00:36:35,585 --> 00:36:39,570
尖叫聲 歡呼聲
[Screaming] [Cheering]

416
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:53,760
來 表演一下妳最拿手的招式 秀出妳的招牌動作 現場的大家 要叫妳們什麼呢
Come on, show us your best move! Show us your signature move! What should we call you, girls?

417
00:36:53,760 --> 00:37:01,400
